 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Honestly, a simple rolling bag that folds up tiny is your friend. Look for a good handle and zip that keeps the bag inside dry. A small notepad and a few pens in your pockets are enough for day at the desk. Look at their accessories. A bag that pops open with one hand is worth it, especially if it also acts as a pad while you work. Stick with what you like. Some keyboards come with a small drawer under the left for pens and little items. That's nice.",
